<HelloFraandsPage title="Refund & cancellation" summary="Call ke paise wapas nahi hote — wallet mein bache hue paise 180 din ke andar wapas ho sakte hain." review={true} related={[{"href":"/wallet-terms","label":"Wallet terms"},{"href":"/terms","label":"Terms of use"},{"href":"/grievance","label":"Grievance redressal"}]}>
<h2>No refunds for calls</h2>
<p>{BRAND.name} does not offer refunds for connected calls. You choose the influencer, you see the call price before you call, and you can hang up at any second, so you are only charged for the connected time you chose to stay on the call.</p>
<h2>We are not responsible for how a call went</h2>
<p>{BRAND.name} connects you with an independent influencer. We are not responsible for your experience with a particular influencer, so we cannot refund a call because the conversation was not what you hoped for. Rate the influencer, try someone else, and <a href="/report">report the influencer</a> if they broke a rule.</p>
<h2>No connection means no charge</h2>
<p>Billing starts only when both people are connected. Ringing, an influencer declining, a timeout before connection or a call that fails to connect costs nothing. Calls are billed by the minute of connected time, including when either person hangs up, presses # or the call is ended by a safety action.</p>
<h2>Billing errors are corrected</h2>
<p>If you are charged for a call that never connected, or charged twice for the same call, that is a billing error, not a refund request. Report it with the call ID, date and time and it will be checked against the call details and the wrong amount put back in your wallet, linked to that call.</p>
<h2>Your unused balance is always yours</h2>
<p>Unused wallet money can be refunded on request within 180 days. This includes accounts that have been banned: a banned account cannot make calls, but can still sign in and request the refund.</p>
<h2>Information for a billing query</h2>
<p>Provide the call ID, date and time, amount, transaction reference and a short explanation, and keep your receipt. Never send an OTP, UPI PIN, Aadhaar number or full card details — we will never ask for them. See the <a href="/grievance">grievance page</a> for how to raise a complaint, and the <a href="/help">help centre</a> for simple guides on the <a href="/help/wallet-and-payments/no-refunds">no-refund rule</a> and <a href="/help/wallet-and-payments/billing-errors">billing mistakes</a>.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
